        <p class="display mt-3 text-[clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5.5rem)]">無料。</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/70">有料プランや手数料はありません。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:pt-9">
        <dl class="divide-y divide-paper/20 border-y border-paper/20">
          <div class="grid gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[9.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="font-bold">Chrome・Chrome+</dt>
            <dd class="text-paper/70">無料。</dd>
